# Doc Samson, Super Psychiatrist: "If you would put one or more counters on a permanent you control, put that many plus one of each of those
# kinds of counters on that permanent instead. {T}: Add X mana of any one color, where X is Doc Samson's power." On turn 3 he taps for three
# green (his power 3), which pays Go Nuts! (leaving two green): Go Nuts! puts a counter on him, and he gets two (5/8), and so taps for five
# the next time. Abigale, Eloquent First-Year then puts a flying, a first strike and a lifelink counter on Bot2's Grizzly Bears: Bot2's
# permanent is not one Bot1 controls, so each kind stays one counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Gleemox
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Doc Samson, Super Psychiatrist
Abigale, Eloquent First-Year
Go Nuts!
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Forest
Grizzly Bears
Island x20

